join phone right [extra_data="set Screen/IncomingCall, set Person/Mom"]
RING RING RING
join protag left
protag: Ugh...
protag: I feel like garbage...
protag: It's like there's a timer in my head and I'm going to die if it hits zero.
- Pick up the phone
	*click*
	protag: Hello?
	update phone [extra_data="set Screen/CallPresent"]
	mom: Hey! It's me!
	mom: How's it going?
	protag: I feel kind of gross Mom.
	mom: Hmmm...
	mom: Like there's a timer in your head and you're going to die if it hits zero?
	- Uh, yeah!
