	protag: What am I supposed to do?
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"Camera":"TutorialCamera","Priority":15}"]
	mom: Do you see any Gremlins?
	protag: Uh, yeah. I do.
	label tut
	mom: Try killing those Gremlins with the Mystic Artes.
	if {using_gamepad} == true:
		mom: Try holding down the left trigger, then press the face buttons to light up the Gremlin.
	else:
		mom: Try holding down the shift key, then pressing the onscreen keys to light up the Gremlin.
	mom: Once it's all lit up and flashing red, you can probably just walk up and stab it with your knife.
	mom: It's as easy as touching one!
	protag: What if I touch it when it's not lit up all red?
	mom: [b]Don't do that![/b]
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"Camera":"TutorialCamera","Priority":0}"]
	mom: Does that make sense?
	- Yes
		protag: Uh, yeah, I think so.
	- Please explain it again
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"Camera":"TutorialCamera","Priority":15}"]
		jump tut
	if {using_gamepad} == true:
		protag: Sounds like I just need to hold the left trigger and mash the face buttons until gremlins light up.
	else:
		protag: Sounds like I just need to hold shift and mash the face buttons until gremlins light up.
	mom: You'll get more time on the clock once you absorb their essence.
	mom: Just don't run out, okay?
	mom: We'll see you at Christmas!
